rators (https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/30811).\nNote that Quarkus/Arc doesn't have full support of decorators like Weld.\nI am not sure how far we are with supporting these cases, can take a look on Mon.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1575067095/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"manovotn","id":4181235,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxODEyMzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4181235?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn","html_url":"https://github.com/manovotn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/manovotn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1576164484","html_url":"https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/33803#issuecomment-1576164484","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/33803","id":1576164484,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCFbutM5d8lyE","user":{"login":"Ladicek","id":480590,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDU5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/480590?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek","html_url":"https://github.com/Ladicek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-06-05T07:05:41Z","updated_at":"2023-06-05T07:05:41Z","body":"`java.lang.NoSuchMethodError: 'java.lang.String org.acme.LoggingRepository.get()'`\r\n\r\nThe decorator only has a method with return type of `Object` (after erasure), so not sure where that `String` comes from. Perhaps we expect the decorators have a method with the same signature/descriptor as the decorated class? Or something like that.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/quarkusio/quarkus/issues/comments/1576164484/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Ladicek","id":480590,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MDU5MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/480590?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek","html_url":"https://github.com/Ladicek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ladicek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://ap